Dave neglected to mention that the gods prefer that sacrifices be real
_sacrifices_; piddly little corpses that don't do much for your hunger
don't do much for the gods, either.  These aren't the stupid Greek gods,
that buy off on the skin, guts and fat; these gods are into gluttony.

Better put a GROSS SPOILER warning here.



There is one really hard to kill creature with an obvious alignment that
your god would prefer to see wiped out of the other god's followers and
sacrificed on your god's altar instead. Doing so _really_ puts you in
right with the Powers That Be and way ahead in line for the artifact de
jour, too.

